[
  {
    "text": "A Kodiak woman asked Google when",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.6900000000000004,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "snipe season opens.",
    "start": 2.72,
    "end": 4.0,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "She told troopers its A I",
    "start": 5.3,
    "end": 6.989999999999999,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "answer said September first.",
    "start": 7.02,
    "end": 9.22,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "So on September fifth she shot",
    "start": 10.02,
    "end": 12.57,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "three snipe.",
    "start": 12.6,
    "end": 13.46,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "At home she opened the state",
    "start": 14.54,
    "end": 16.529999999999998,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "regulations and saw her mistake.",
    "start": 16.56,
    "end": 19.24,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "She called troopers and turned",
    "start": 20.42,
    "end": 22.61,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "herself in.",
    "start": 22.64,
    "end": 23.34,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "The trooper's report says the general",
    "start": 25.18,
    "end": 27.91,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "season opened October eighth.",
    "start": 27.94,
    "end": 30.26,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "So the answer and the report",
    "start": 30.6,
    "end": 32.71,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "disagreed.",
    "start": 32.74,
    "end": 33.66,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "That trooper ran her exact search.",
    "start": 34.52,
    "end": 37.16,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "He got the same wrong answer.",
    "start": 38.32,
    "end": 40.16,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "So which page can a hunter",
    "start": 41.28,
    "end": 42.87,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "trust?",
    "start": 42.9,
    "end": 43.6,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "She pleaded no contest and paid",
    "start": 44.32,
    "end": 46.93,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "a hundred fifty dollars.",
    "start": 46.96,
    "end": 47.68,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "She told the Alaska Beacon, I",
    "start": 49.04,
    "end": 52.07,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "feel terrible.",
    "start": 52.1,
    "end": 53.44,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "State spokesman Austin McDaniel",
    "start": 55.74,
    "end": 57.83,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "says he thinks it's the first",
    "start": 57.86,
    "end": 59.53,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "time A I has been cited.",
    "start": 59.56,
    "end": 61.14,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "He expects more.",
    "start": 61.98,
    "end": 62.92,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "Weren't there warnings?",
    "start": 64.54,
    "end": 65.6,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "There were.",
    "start": 66.54,
    "end": 67.24000000000001,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "Google's help page says A I",
    "start": 68.34,
    "end": 70.15,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "answers may include mistakes, and",
    "start": 70.18,
    "end": 72.63,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "to check more than one place.",
    "start": 72.66,
    "end": 74.1,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "Google didn't respond to the Beacon's",
    "start": 75.26,
    "end": 77.39,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "request for comment on the wrong",
    "start": 77.42,
    "end": 78.83,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "answer.",
    "start": 78.86,
    "end": 79.56,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "McDaniel says the one source of",
    "start": 80.78,
    "end": 82.85,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "truth is Fish and Game's regulations",
    "start": 82.88,
    "end": 84.78999999999999,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "and emergency orders.",
    "start": 84.82,
    "end": 86.1,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "But that source has a catch.",
    "start": 86.96,
    "end": 88.64,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "Fish and Game's own page says",
    "start": 89.9,
    "end": 91.91,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "its online regulations are simplified,",
    "start": 91.94,
    "end": 93.92999999999999,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "and emergency orders can override",
    "start": 93.96,
    "end": 96.25,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "them.",
    "start": 96.28,
    "end": 96.98,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "So even the official page is",
    "start": 97.4,
    "end": 99.57,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "a simplified summary of state law.",
    "start": 99.6,
    "end": 101.58,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "The answer was on top.",
    "start": 102.88,
    "end": 104.52,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "What counts sits underneath, the",
    "start": 105.82,
    "end": 108.19,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "regulations and any emergency order.",
    "start": 108.22,
    "end": 110.42,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "Check them first.",
    "start": 111.3,
    "end": 112.32,
    "seg": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "Fish and Game will mail you",
    "start": 113.24,
    "end": 114.42999999999999,
    "seg": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "the regulations, or you can call",
    "start": 114.46,
    "end": 116.17,
    "seg": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "the office.",
    "start": 116.2,
    "end": 116.9,
    "seg": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "Before you hunt, what do you",
    "start": 117.44,
    "end": 119.75,
    "seg": 20
  },
  {
    "text": "check?",
    "start": 119.78,
    "end": 120.48,
    "seg": 20
  }
]